ta-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6ae82d5d-c660-83ec-9016-d84695838fc0" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="3a8cb586-fa7f-42f7-b097-0472346b47a9"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_1u3_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="3a8cb586-fa7f-42f7-b097-0472346b47a9" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="2" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="3a8cb586-fa7f-42f7-b097-0472346b47a9"><h1 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold">JARVIS – Indian Live News Intelligence Module</h1><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">You can add this as a dedicated <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Live News &amp; Media Intelligence</span> module inside your existing JARVIS project.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Your list contains 10 languages and 46 YouTube channel live-stream pages. The best approach is to organize them by language, provide live-stream discovery, and let JARVIS open or play available broadcasts using the existing media player.</p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">1. News dashboard structure</h2><div class="Box-