uTube page.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Automatic refresh:</span> Periodically refresh broadcast availability.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Favorites:</span> Save preferred channels.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Voice control:</span> Open channels through natural language.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">News intelligence:</span> Summarize accessible headlines and news content, with source attribution.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Multichannel viewing:</span> Support a configurable multi-screen news wall where permitted.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Search:</span> Search channels, topics and available broadcasts.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Fallback:</span> If a channel is not live, show its latest available videos or its official streams page.</p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Important:</span> A channel's <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">/streams</code> page is not proof that it is broadcasting live. JARVIS must verify live status before displaying a LIVE indicator.</p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">3. Complete implementation prompt for Claude Code</h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Copy this into Claude Code inside <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">D:\J_A_R_V_I_S</code>.</p><div data-client-defined-widget="writing_block"><div class="group/writing-block-surface relative isolate w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip rounded-[var(--oai-wb-radius)] [box-shadow:var(--oai-wb-shadow)] [color:var(--oai-wb-text-primary)] [contain:inline-size] [font-family:var(--oai-wb-font-sans)] frame-aD2tvA editorControls-fA0_fZ z-10 clear-both my-4 in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:my-0 in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:overflow-y-auto in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:overscroll-contain in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:scrollbar-none [--wb-surface-primary:color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-surface-elevated-secondary)_86%,var(--color-surface))] [--wb-accent:var(--codex-base-accent,var(--color-text-info,var(--color-text)))] [--wb-interactive-background:var(--color-background-primary-ghost-hover)] [--wb-on-accent:var(--color-text-info-solid,var(--color-text-inverse,#fff))] [--wb-selection:var(--color-background-text-selection)] [--wb-font-size:var(--codex-chat-font-size,0.875rem)]" data-oai-writing-block-surface="" data-markdown-copy="rich-block" data-markdown-copy-text="# JARVIS MULTILINGUAL INDIAN LIVE NEWS INTELLIGENCE MODULE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, AI agent architect, media streaming engineer and YouTube API integration specialist.

Upgrade my existing JARVIS project with a complete Indian multilingual Live News Intelligence module.

Existing repository:
https://github.com/kv-sudeep/jarviskishkinda

Local project:
D:\J_A_R_V_I_S

The module must integrate into the existing JARVIS application without replacing existing features.

## 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Create a professional news center that brings Indian news channels from ten languages into one unified dashboard.

Supported languages:

1. Hindi
2. English
3. Tamil
4. Telugu
5. Kannada
6. Malayalam
7. Bengali
8. Marathi
9. Gujarati
10. Punjabi

Initial directory: 46 channel entries supplied below.

The system must:
- Discover active public live broadcasts.
- Display verified live status.
- Play available broadcasts.
- Search news channels.
- Filter by language.
- Support favorites.
- Provide voice commands.
- Summarize available news.
- Display news headlines.
- Support historical and latest videos.
- Provide an intelligent news assistant.

