style="--oai-wb-spacing: var(--spacing,0.25rem); --oai-wb-text-primary: var(--wb-text-primary,var(--color-token-text-primary,var(--text-primary,#0d0d0d))); --oai-wb-text-secondary: var(--wb-text-secondary,var(--color-token-text-secondary,var(--text-secondary,#5d5d5d))); --oai-wb-text-tertiary: var(--wb-text-tertiary,var(--color-token-text-tertiary,var(--text-tertiary,#8f8f8f))); --oai-wb-surface-primary: var(--wb-surface-primary,var(--color-token-main-surface-primary,var(--main-surface-primary,#fff))); --oai-wb-surface-secondary: var(--wb-surface-secondary,var(--color-token-bg-tertiary,var(--main-surface-secondary,#f5f5f5))); --oai-wb-interactive-secondary-hover: var(--wb-interactive-secondary-hover,var(--color-token-interactive-bg-secondary-hover,var(--oai-wb-surface-secondary))); --oai-wb-border: var(--wb-border,var(--color-token-border,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/8%)))); --oai-wb-border-hover: var(--wb-border-hover,var(--color-token-border-default,var(--border-medium,rgb(0 0 0/12%)))); --oai-wb-divider: var(--wb-divider,var(--color-token-border-light,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/5%)))); --oai-wb-focus: var(--wb-focus,var(--color-token-focus-border,var(--border-strong,#5b9dd9))); --oai-wb-control-border: var(--wb-control-border,var(--interactive-border-focus,var(--oai-wb-focus))); --oai-wb-entity-accent: var(--wb-entity-accent,var(--theme-entity-accent,var(--oai-wb-accent))); --oai-wb-accent: var(--wb-accent,var(--interactive-label-accent-default,#0285ff)); --oai-wb-on-accent: var(--wb-on-accent,var(--bg-primary,#fff)); --oai-wb-interactive-background: var(--wb-interactive-background,var(--interactive-bg-accent-default,color-mix(in srgb,#0285ff 12%,transparent))); --oai-wb-selection: var(--wb-selection,var(--theme-user-selection-bg,var(--selection,#93c5fd))); --oai-wb-radius: var(--wb-radius,1.5rem); --oai-wb-radius-sm: var(--wb-radius-sm,0.5rem); --oai-wb-shadow: var(--wb-shadow,0 4px 80px rgb(0 0 0/2%)); --oai-wb-shadow-lg: var(--wb-shadow-lg,0 10px 30px rgb(0 0 0/12%)); --oai-wb-font-sans: var(--wb-font-sans,var(--font-sans,sans-serif)); --oai-wb-font-mono: var(--wb-font-mono,var(--font-mono,monospace)); --oai-wb-font-size: var(--wb-font-size,0.875rem); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-contrast: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-contrast,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary)); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-secondary: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-secondary,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary));"><div contenteditable="true" aria-label="Start writing" aria-multiline="true" role="textbox" translate="no" class="ProseMirror content-xaiQhS leading-relaxed"><h1 dir="auto"><span>JARVIS MULTILINGUAL INDIAN LIVE NEWS INTELLIGENCE MODULE</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>Act as a senior full-stack engineer, AI agent architect, media streaming engineer and YouTube API integration specialist.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Upgrade my existing JARVIS project with a complete Indian multilingual Live News Intelligence module.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Existing repository:</span><br><a href="https://github.com/kv-sudeep/jarviskishkinda" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://github.com/kv-sudeep/jarviskishkinda</span></a></p><p dir="auto"><span>Local project:</span><br><span>D:\J_A_R_V_I_S</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>The module must integrate into the existing JARVIS application without replacing existing features.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Create a professional news center that brings Indian news channels from ten languages into one unified dashboard.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Supported languages:</span></p><ol start="1" data-spread="false" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 2ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Hindi</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>English</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Tamil</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Telugu</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Kannada</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Malayalam</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Bengali</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Marathi</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Gujarati</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Punjabi</span></p></li></ol><p dir="auto"><span>Initial directory: 46 channel entries supplied below.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>The system must:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Discover active public live broadcasts.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Display verified live status.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Play available broadcasts.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Search news channels.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Filter by language.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Support favorites.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Provide voice commands.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Summarize available news.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Display news headlines.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Support historical and latest videos.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Provide an intelligent news assistant.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir="auto"><span>2. COMPLETE CHANNEL DIRECTORY</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Use these official channel handles and streams URLs as the initial database seed.</span></p><h3 dir="auto"><span>HINDI</span></h3><ol start="1" data-spread="true" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 1ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Aaj Tak</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@aajtak/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@aajtak/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>India TV</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@indiatv/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@indiatv/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>ABP News</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ABPNews/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@ABPNews/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Zee News</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@zeenews/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@zeenews/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News18 India</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@News18India/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@News18India/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>NDTV India</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ndtvindia/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@ndtvindia/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Republic Bharat</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@RepublicBharat/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@RepublicBharat/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>TV9 Bharatvarsh</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@TV9Bharatvarsh/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@TV9Bharatvarsh/streams</span></a></p></li></ol><h3 dir="auto"><span>ENGLISH</span></h3><ol start="1" data-spread="true" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 1ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>NDTV</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@NDTV/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@NDTV/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>India Today</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@indiatoday/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@indiatoday/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Times Now</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@TimesNow/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@TimesNow/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>CNN-News18</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@CNNNews18/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@CNNNews18/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Republic</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@RepublicWorld/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@RepublicWorld/streams</span></a></p></li></ol><h3 dir="auto"><span>TAMIL</span></h3><ol start="1" data-spread="true" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 1ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Sun News</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@SunNews/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@SunNews/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Thanthi TV</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ThanthiTV/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@ThanthiTV/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News18 Tamil Nadu</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@News18TamilNadu/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@News18TamilNadu/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Puthiya Thalaimurai</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PuthiyaThalaimuraiTV/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@PuthiyaThalaimuraiTV/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Polimer News</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PolimerNews/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@PolimerNews/streams</span></a></p></li></ol><h3 dir="auto"><span>TELUGU</span></h3><ol start="1" data-spread="true" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 1ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>TV9 Telugu</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@TV9TeluguLive/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@TV9TeluguLive/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>NTV Telugu</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@NTVTelugu/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@NTVTelugu/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>ABN Andhra Jyothi</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ABNAndhraJyothy/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@ABNAndhraJyothy/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Sakshi TV</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@SakshiTV/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@SakshiTV/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>V6 News</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@V6News/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@V6News/streams</span></a></p></li></ol><h3 dir="auto"><span>KANNADA</span></h3><ol start="1" data-spread="true" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 1ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>TV9 Kannada</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@TV9Kannada/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@TV9Kannada/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Public TV</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PublicTVNews/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@PublicTVNews/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Suvarna News</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@SuvarnaNews/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@SuvarnaNews/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News18 Kannada</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@News18Kannada/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@News18Kannada/streams</span></a></p></li></ol><h3 dir="auto"><span>MALAYALAM</span></h3><ol start="1" data-spread="true" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 1ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Asianet News</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@asianetnews/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@asianetnews/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Manorama News</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@manoramanews/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@manoramanews/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Mathrubhumi News</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@mathrubhuminews/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@mathrubhuminews/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News18 Kerala</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@News18Kerala/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@News18Kerala/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Media One</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@MediaOneTVLive/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@MediaOneTVLive/streams</span></a></p></li></ol><h3 dir="auto"><span>BENGALI</span></h3><ol start="1" data-spread="true" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 1ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>ABP Ananda</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ABPAnanda/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@ABPAnanda/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Zee 24 Ghanta</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Zee24Ghanta/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@Zee24Ghanta/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News18 Bangla</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@News18Bangla/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@News18Bangla/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Kolkata TV</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@KolkataTV/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@KolkataTV/streams</span></a></p></li></ol><h3 dir="auto"><span>MARATHI</span></h3><ol start="1" data-spread="true" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 1ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>ABP Majha</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ABPMajha/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@ABPMajha/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>TV9 Marathi</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@TV9Marathi/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@TV9Marathi/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News18 Lokmat</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@News18Lokmat/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@News18Lokmat/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Zee 24 Taas</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Zee24Taas/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@Zee24Taas/streams</span></a></p></li></ol><h3 dir="auto"><span>GUJARATI</span></h3><ol start="1" data-spread="true" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 1ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>TV9 Gujarati</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@TV9Gujarati/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@TV9Gujarati/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>ABP Asmita</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ABPAsmita/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@ABPAsmita/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News18 Gujarati</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@News18Gujarati/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@News18Gujarati/streams</span></a></p></li></ol><h3 dir="auto"><span>PUNJABI</span></h3><ol start="1" data-spread="true" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 1ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>ABP Sanjha</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ABPSanjha/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@ABPSanjha/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News18 Punjab</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@News18PunjabHaryanaHimachal/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@News18PunjabHaryanaHimachal/streams</span></a></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>PTC News</span><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PTCNews/streams" data-rich-text-autolink=""><span>https://www.youtube.com/@PTCNews/streams</span></a></p></li></ol><h2 dir="auto"><span>3. LIVE BROADCAST DETECTION ENGINE</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Implement real-time broadcast discovery.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Preferred integration:</span><br><span>YouTube Data API v3.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Use:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>channels.list to resolve channel handles to channel IDs.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>search.list with eventType=live and type=video to discover active broadcasts.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>videos.list to retrieve broadcast metadata and embeddability status.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Requirements:</span></p><ol start="1" data-spread="false" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 2ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Resolve and cache channel IDs.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Search for active broadcasts.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Associate broadcasts with the correct channel.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Retrieve video ID.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Retrieve title.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Retrieve thumbnail.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Retrieve publication/start information where available.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Retrieve channel name.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Check embeddability.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Cache results to minimize API quota consumption.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Refresh results on a configurable schedule.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Handle API quota limits.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Handle missing API credentials.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Handle deleted and private broadcasts.</span></p></li></ol><p dir="auto"><span>Never mark a channel as LIVE simply because its streams page exists.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>LIVE status must come from verified current broadcast information.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Use the following status categories:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>LIVE: verified active public broadcast.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>OFFLINE: no verified current broadcast.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>UPCOMING: scheduled upcoming broadcast.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>UNAVAILABLE: channel or API could not be checked.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>RESTRICTED: broadcast cannot be embedded.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Do not confuse API errors with OFFLINE status.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Provide an official YouTube fallback link for every channel.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Do not scrape YouTube pages as the primary live detection mechanism.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>4. NEWS DASHBOARD DESIGN</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Build a professional JARVIS News Center.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Visual design:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Dark futuristic interface.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Iron Man/JARVIS-inspired styling.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Modern cards.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Smooth animations.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Responsive layout.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>High-quality thumbnails.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Clear language indicators.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Professional typography.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Consistent with existing JARVIS design.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Main navigation:</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>NEWS CENTER</span><br><span>├── All News</span><br><span>├── Live Now</span><br><span>├── Hindi</span><br><span>├── English</span><br><span>├── Tamil</span><br><span>├── Telugu</span><br><span>├── Kannada</span><br><span>├── Malayalam</span><br><span>├── Bengali</span><br><span>├── Marathi</span><br><span>├── Gujarati</span><br><span>├── Punjabi</span><br><span>├── Favorites</span><br><span>├── Latest Videos</span><br><span>├── News Search</span><br><span>└── News Intelligence</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Dashboard widgets:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Total registered channels.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Verified live broadcasts.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Upcoming broadcasts.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Offline channels.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Favorite channels.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Recently watched channels.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Do not show invented live counts.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>5. LIVE TV PLAYER</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Implement an integrated news player.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>YouTube embedded player.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Play and pause.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Fullscreen.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Volume control.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Playback state.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Channel information.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Video title.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Original YouTube link.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Related broadcast suggestions.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Error handling.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Responsive video layout.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>When a broadcast is embeddable, play it inside JARVIS.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>When embedding is disabled, open the original YouTube page.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Respect YouTube playback policies and copyright restrictions.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Do not download, extract or redistribute copyrighted live broadcasts.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Do not use unofficial stream extraction as the default playback method.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>6. MULTI-CHANNEL NEWS WALL</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Create a configurable multichannel viewing experience.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Support:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Single-screen mode.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Two-screen mode.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Four-screen mode.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Six-screen mode.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Nine-screen mode.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Allow users to select channels for each panel.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Requirements:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Each panel must have its own player.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Only initialize players when needed.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Allow individual fullscreen.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Allow closing panels.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Handle unavailable streams.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Display actual channel names and status.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Do not claim a channel is live without verification.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Use lazy loading to control resource consumption.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>7. LANGUAGE FILTERING</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Create a language selector.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Users must be able to choose any of the ten supported languages.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>When a language is selected:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Show only its registered channels.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Show verified active broadcasts first.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Show offline channels separately.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Provide channel search.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Provide favorites.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Preserve the selected language.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Support an All Languages option.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>8. NEWS SEARCH</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Create intelligent news search.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Search by:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Channel.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Language.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News title.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Topic.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Keyword.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Broadcast availability.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Integrate accessible metadata from authorized sources.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Use the YouTube Data API where appropriate.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>For general news headlines, optionally integrate Google News RSS and verified news publishers.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Clearly identify each article's publisher and original source.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Never invent news headlines or publication dates.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>9. JARVIS AI NEWS ASSISTANT</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Connect the News Center to the existing JARVIS voice assistant.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Implement dedicated AI tools:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>get_news_channels</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>get_live_broadcasts</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>get_channel_live_status</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>open_news_channel</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>play_news_broadcast</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>search_news_videos</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>get_latest_news_videos</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>get_news_by_language</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>add_news_favorite</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>remove_news_favorite</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>get_news_favorites</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>summarize_news_content</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>compare_news_coverage</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Example voice commands:</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"JARVIS, open Aaj Tak live."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Play India Today."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Show all live Hindi news channels."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Open Kannada news."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Play TV9 Kannada."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Show all available Telugu news broadcasts."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Open four news channels simultaneously."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Which channels are currently live?"</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Show my favorite news channels."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Find the latest news about artificial intelligence."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Summarize the available headlines."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Compare how different news channels are covering this topic."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Stop the news."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>"Switch to Malayalam news."</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>The assistant must identify the requested channel and language accurately.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>If multiple channels have similar names, ask for clarification.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Never report that a broadcast is playing before playback has actually started.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>10. AI NEWS INTELLIGENCE</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Create a news analysis engine.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ol start="1" data-spread="false" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 2ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Headline summarization.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Topic extraction.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News categorization.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Political news classification.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Business news classification.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Technology news classification.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Sports news classification.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>International news classification.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Breaking news discovery.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Multi-source coverage comparison.</span></p></li></ol><p dir="auto"><span>Use accessible articles, authorized metadata, captions where available and user-provided transcripts.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Distinguish:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Verified facts.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Publisher claims.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Opinions.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Unverified reports.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Attach source references to summaries.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Do not fabricate transcripts or claim to have watched a broadcast when only its title or description was available.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>11. BACKEND ARCHITECTURE</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Adapt to the existing JARVIS backend.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Suggested module:</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>backend/modules/news_intelligence/</span></p><pre><code><span>channel_registry.py
youtube_api.py
live_detector.py
broadcast_discovery.py
video_metadata.py
news_search.py
news_summarizer.py
news_classifier.py
favorites_service.py
player_service.py
news_agent_tools.py
news_cache.py
news_scheduler.py</span></code></pre><p dir="auto"><span>Keep provider integrations independent.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Use background tasks for broadcast discovery.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Use Redis caching if already available in the project.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Do not introduce a conflicting backend framework.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>12. DATABASE</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Inspect the existing database and ORM first.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Suggested entities:</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>NewsChannel</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>name</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>language</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>youtube_handle</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>youtube_channel_id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>streams_url</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>logo_url</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>enabled</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>NewsBroadcast</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>channel_id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>youtube_video_id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>title</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>thumbnail</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>status</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>is_embeddable</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>discovered_at</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>last_checked_at</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>NewsFavorite</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>user_id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>channel_id</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>NewsWatchHistory</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>user_id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>channel_id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>video_id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>watched_at</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>NewsPreference</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>user_id</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>preferred_languages</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>autoplay_enabled</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Use proper relationships and indexes.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Avoid storing unnecessary duplicated metadata.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>13. API ENDPOINTS</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Create endpoints following existing project conventions.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/channels</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/channels/languages</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/channels/{id}</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/live</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/live/{channel_id}</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/broadcasts</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/search</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/latest</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/favorites</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>POST /api/news/favorites</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>DELETE /api/news/favorites/{id}</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/history</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>GET /api/news/analytics</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>All user-specific endpoints must require authentication.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>14. ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Add required configuration to .env.example.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>YOUTUBE_API_KEY=</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>NEWS_REFRESH_INTERVAL=300</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>NEWS_CACHE_TTL=180</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>NEWS_DEFAULT_LANGUAGE=all</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>NEWS_ENABLE_MULTI_VIEW=true</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>NEWS_MAX_PLAYER_COUNT=4</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Never expose the YouTube API key in frontend code.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Validate configuration at application startup.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Handle missing API keys gracefully.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Use configurable refresh intervals and respect API quota limits.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>15. TESTING</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Test:</span></p><ol start="1" data-spread="false" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 2ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>All ten language categories.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>All 46 channel records.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Channel handle resolution.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Live broadcast discovery.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Offline detection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Upcoming broadcast detection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Embeddability.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Player opening.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Language filtering.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Search.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Favorites.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Watch history.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Voice command interpretation.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>API quota failure.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Missing credentials.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Network failure.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Multi-channel player.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Responsive interface.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Unauthorized access.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Database persistence.</span></p></li></ol><p dir="auto"><span>Use mocked API responses for automated tests.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Test actual YouTube API integration separately when a valid API key is configured.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>16. DEVELOPMENT PHASES</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 1: Inspect existing JARVIS architecture.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 2: Create the 46-channel seed database.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 3: Implement YouTube channel ID resolution.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 4: Implement live broadcast detection.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 5: Build the multilingual dashboard.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 6: Implement the video player.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 7: Implement multi-channel viewing.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 8: Implement news search and latest videos.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 9: Integrate JARVIS voice commands.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 10: Implement AI news intelligence.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 11: Complete testing and documentation.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>17. ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>The module is complete when:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>All 46 channel entries are registered.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>All ten languages work.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Channels can be searched.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Actual live broadcasts are discovered.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Live and offline statuses are distinguished.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Available broadcasts can be played.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Non-embeddable broadcasts have an official fallback.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Favorites work.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Multi-channel mode works.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Voice commands work.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>News summaries cite accessible sources.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>API failures are handled correctly.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Existing JARVIS functionality remains intact.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir="auto"><span>FINAL INSTRUCTION</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>Work directly in the existing JARVIS repository.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Do not create a mock-only dashboard.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Do not hardcode live status.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Do not fabricate broadcasts.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Do not expose API keys.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Do not replace existing JARVIS modules.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Implement each phase, test it, fix errors and document it.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>The final goal is to make JARVIS a multilingual Indian news command center that can discover, open, play, search and intelligently summarize news from official news channel sources.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] z-[2] [box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--oai-wb-border)] group-hover/writing-block-surface:[box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--oai-wb-border-hover)]"></div></div></div><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">4. Suggested final dashboard</h2><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" data-d-flex-in-row="" style="flex: var(--w-box-flex-in-row, 0 0 auto); max-width: 768px; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 768px;"><div><div class="Grid-CGRmTR" data-d-component="grid" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2); grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0px, 1fr));"><div class="Box-qIMv6G Item-ev4eoI" data-d-component="grid-item" data-d-direction="col" data-d-variant="transparent" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); --grid-item-column: span 3; --grid-item-row: auto;"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" data-d-flex-in-row="" data-d-has-height="" style="aspect-ratio: 363 / 200; flex: var(--w-box-flex-in-row, 0 0 auto); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0.5); max-width: 768px; min-height: 0px; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-