"TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="xs" data-d-weight="semibold" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--white);">13</span></div></div></button></div><div class="ActionOverlayContainer-a3RMbn"><div class="ActionOverlay-I6aAHz"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-3 top-3 z-10"><div class="select-none pointer-events-none opacity-0 pointer-coarse:pointer-events-auto pointer-coarse:opacity-100 group-hover/generated-image-preview:pointer-events-auto group-hover/generated-image-preview:opacity-100 group-has-focus-visible/generated-image-preview:pointer-events-auto group-has-focus-visible/generated-image-preview:opacity-100 group-hover/search-image:pointer-events-auto group-hover/search-image:opacity-100 group-has-focus-visible/search-image:pointer-events-auto group-has-focus-visible/search-image:opacity-100" data-saved="false" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default bg-text/5 not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-text/10 data-[state=open]:bg-text/10 border-transparent px-2 py-0.5 text-sm leading-[18px] group/gallery-action !bg-transparent !p-0 !text-media-foreground enabled:hover:!bg-transparent size-9 outline-hidden cursor-interaction" aria-label="Add to Favorites" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-pressed="false" id="radix-_r_20v_" data-state="closed"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-media-background/45 backdrop-blur-md group-hover/gallery-action:bg-media-background/60 group-focus/gallery-action:bg-media-background/60"><svg aria-hidden="true" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/startup-v2/optimized/assets/icons-8f0081c9239bae1d.svg#codex-icon-bookmark-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div><span class="pointer-events-none absolute end-3 bottom-3 inline-flex opacity-0 group-focus-within/generated-image-preview:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/generated-image-preview:opacity-100 group-focus-within/search-image:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/search-image:opacity-100 group-hover/generated-image-preview:pointer-events-auto group-hover/generated-image-preview:opacity-100 group-hover/search-image:pointer-events-auto group-hover/search-image:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:pointer-events-auto [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100"></span></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="Frame-QDM1Eq"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">5. One important setup requirement</h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">You should obtain a YouTube Data API key from:</p><span class="Trigger-C5mz9C" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inline="" role="presentation" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><a class="" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" href="https://console.cloud.google.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted">Google Cloud Console</span><span class="ms-1"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l6.778-6.779H9.172a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h7.07Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></span><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Enable <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">YouTube Data API v3</span>, create an API key and configure it in your backend <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">.env</code> file.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">The API has quota limits, so cache channel IDs and broadcast discovery results instead of repeatedly searching all 46 channels.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">My recommendation:</span> Build this after the core JARVIS media player integration. Then the same media engine can handle YouTube videos, music, live news and your future video-editing features.</p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-g