matting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT said:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6ae82d5d-c660-83ec-9016-d84695838fc0" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="bfbc79b2-8e28-4c93-a35e-b68d905b588f"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_1sr_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="bfbc79b2-8e28-4c93-a35e-b68d905b588f" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="2" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="bfbc79b2-8e28-4c93-a35e-b68d905b588f"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Below is a complete master prompt you can give to <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Claude Code</span> to build a professional 3D gaming website with 20 playable games.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">The prompt instructs Claude to build the actual website and games, not just create a UI design or static game cards.</p><div data-client-defined-widget="writing_block"><div class="group/writing-block-surface relative isolate w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip rounded-[var(--oai-wb-radius)] [box-shadow:var(--oai-wb-shadow)] [color:var(--oai-wb-text-primary)] [contain:inline-size] [font-family:var(--oai-wb-font-sans)] frame-aD2tvA editorControls-fA0_fZ z-10 clear-both my-4 in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:my-0 in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:overflow-y-auto in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:overscroll-contain in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:scrollbar-none [--wb-surface-primary:color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-surface-elevated-secondary)_86%,var(--color-surface))] [--wb-accent:var(--codex-base-accent,var(--color-text-info,var(--color-text)))] [--wb-interactive-background:var(--color-background-primary-ghost-hover)] [--wb-on-accent:var(--color-text-info-solid,var(--color-text-inverse,#fff))] [--wb-selection:var(--color-background-text-selection)] [--wb-font-size:var(--codex-chat-font-size,0.875rem)]" data-oai-writing-block-surface="" data-markdown-copy="rich-block" data-markdown-copy-text="# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT: 3D ARCADE GAMING PLATFORM – 20 PLAYABLE GAMES

Act as a senior game developer, Three.js/WebGL engineer, full-stack developer, 3D gameplay designer, UI/UX architect and software architect.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, professional, responsive **3D Gaming Website containing 20 playable 3D games**.

The result must feel like a premium gaming platform, similar in presentation quality to modern browser gaming portals.

IMPORTANT: Do not create only a landing page, static game cards, fake buttons or gameplay screenshots. Every game must have a functional gameplay loop, controls, scoring, collision detection, win/lose conditions and restart functionality.

---

# 1. TECHNOLOGY STACK

First inspect the existing project and identify its framework, folder structure, package manager and current architecture.

Preserve existing functionality if integrating into an existing application.

Recommended technology:

- Frontend: React + TypeScript
- 3D engine: Three.js
- React integration: React Three Fiber
- 3D helpers: Drei
- Physics: Rapier
- Styling: Tailwind CSS or existing styling system
- Animations: Framer Motion
- Backend: Existing backend if available
- Database: Existing database or PostgreSQL
- Authentication: Existing authentication system
- State management: Zustand or existing state solution
- Build tool: Existing Vite/Next.js setup

Do not introduce duplicate frameworks or unnecessary dependencies.

Use modular architecture. Optimize 3D rendering for desktop and mobile browsers.

# 2. WEBSITE BRANDING AND DESIGN

Create a premium gaming brand.

Suggested name: NEXUS 3D ARCADE

Visual direction:
- Dark futuristic interface.
- Black and deep navy backgrounds.
- Neon purple, electric blue and cyan highlights.
- Glassmorphism panels.
- Smooth transitions and animated backgrounds.
- High-quality 3D game thumbnails.
- Modern gaming typography.
- Responsive card layouts.
- Attractive hover effects.
- Premium dashboard appearance.

Main navigation:
- Home
- All Games
- Action
- Racing
- Sports
- Adventure
- Multiplayer
- Leaderboard
- My Profile

Homepage sections:
1. Hero banner featuring a highlighted 3D game.
2. Featured Games.
3. Popular Games.
4. Recently Added.
5. Action and Adventure.
6. Racing and Driving.
7. Sports.
8. Puzzle and Simulation.
9. All 20 Games.
10. Footer with platform information.

# 3. BUILD THESE 20 PLAYABLE 3D GAMES

Every game must have its own dedicated gameplay screen, controls, 3D environment, scoring system and game states.

## ACTION AND ADVENTURE

### Game 1: Open World Adventure
Create a third-person 3D exploration game.

Features:
- Explore a 3D city.
- Walk, run and jump.
- Enter and exit supported vehicles.
- Collect coins and objects.
- Complete missions.
- Map and navigation system.
- NPC characters.
- Mission completion rewards.

### Game 2: Zombie Survival
Create a 3D zombie survival game.

Features:
- Zombie AI.
- Player health.
- Weapon system.
- Ammunition.
- Zombie attack animations.
- Survival waves.
- Health packs.
- Increasing difficulty.
- Game-over and restart screens.

### Game 3: Battle Arena
Create a 3D arena combat game.

Features:
- Third-person player movement.
- AI opponents.
- Weapon mechanics.
- Health and shield.
- Shooting and hit detection.
- Multiple arena environments.
- Score and kill counter.
- Victory and defeat conditions.

### Game 4: Treasure Hunter
Create a 3D treasure exploration game.

Features:
- Ancient temple environment.
- Hidden treasure chests.
- Environmental puzzles.
- Moving platforms.
- Traps and obstacles.
- Collectible objects.
- Multiple levels.
- Level completion rewards.

### Game 5: Extreme Parkour
Create a 3D parkour game.

Features:
- Running and jumping.
- Wall climbing.
- Sliding.
- Rooftop environments.
- Moving platforms.
- Obstacles.
- Checkpoints.
- Timer and distance scoring.

## RACING AND DRIVING

### Game 6: Supercar Racing
Create a 3D racing simulator.

Features:
- Multiple sports cars.
- Realistic acceleration and braking.
- Steering and drifting.
- Nitro boost.
- AI opponents.
- Racing tracks.
- Lap counter.
- Speedometer.
- Race timer.
- Finish-line detection.

### Game 7: Motorcycle Racing
Create a 3D motorcycle racing game.

Features:
- Multiple motorcycles.
- Bike leaning.
- Road physics.
- Traffic obstacles.
- Racing checkpoints.
- Speed boosts.
- Bike selection.
- Race results.

### Game 8: Off-Road Driving
Create a 3D off-road driving simulator.

Features:
- Jeep and 4x4 vehicles.
- Mud and rocky terrain.
- Mountain roads.
- Vehicle suspension.
- Obstacles.
- Checkpoints.
- Time-based challenges.

### Game 9: Space Racing
Create a futuristic 3D spaceship racing game.

Features:
- Spaceship selection.
- Space tracks.
- Asteroid obstacles.
- Boost mechanics.
- AI racers.
- Lap system.
- Futuristic visual effects.

## SPORTS

### Game 10: Football 3D
Create a 3D football game.

Features:
- Player movement.
- Ball physics.
- Goal detection.
- Goalkeeper AI.
- Shooting and passing.
- Match timer.
- Scoreboard.
- Match completion.

### Game 11: Basketball 3D
Create a 3D basketball game.

Features:
- Basketball court.
- Player movement.
- Ball throwing physics.
- Hoop collision detection.
- Scoring system.
- Time challenges.
- Scoreboard.

### Game 12: Cricket 3D
Create a 3D cricket game.

Features:
- Batting mechanics.
- Bowling mechanics.
- Ball physics.
- Wickets.
- Runs and overs.
- Boundary detection.
- Match score.
- Match result.

### Game 13: Tennis 3D
Create a 3D tennis game.

Features:
- Tennis court.
- Player movement.
- Ball physics.
- Serve and return.
- AI opponent.
- Net collision.
- Points and sets.

## SIMULATION AND STRATEGY

### Game 14: City Builder 3D
Create a 3D city construction game.

Features:
- Place buildings.
- Build roads.
- Manage resources.
- Population system.
- City expansion.
- Budget management.
- Camera rotation and zoom.

### Game 15: Flight Simulator
Create a 3D airplane simulator.

Features:
- Aircraft controls.
- Takeoff and landing.
- Altitude indicator.
- Speed indicator.
- Flight camera.
- Airport environment.
- Flight challenges.

### Game 16: Tank Battle
Create a 3D tank combat game.

Features:
- Tank movement.
- Turret rotation.
- Projectile physics.
- AI enemy tanks.
- Health system.
- Destructible targets.
- Battle arenas.

### Game 17: Space Exploration
Create a 3D space exploration game.

Features:
- Explore planets.
- Spaceship controls.
- Asteroid fields.
- Planet landing zones.
- Collect resources.
- Solar systems.
- Exploration missions.

## CLASSIC AND PUZZLE GAMES

### Game 18: 3D Maze Runner
Create a 3D maze exploration game.

Features:
- Procedurally generated or predefined mazes.
- First-person camera.
- Collectible keys.
- Locked doors.
- Timer.
- Traps.
- Exit detection.

### Game 19: 3D Chess
Create a fully playable 3D chess game.

Features:
- 3D chessboard.
- 3D chess pieces.
- Legal move validation.
- Check and checkmate detection.
- Player versus AI.
- Two-player local mode.
- Undo move.
- Restart game.

### Game 20: 3D Tower Defense
Create a 3D tower defense game.

Features:
- 3D map.
- Enemy waves.
- Tower placement.
- Tower upgrades.
- Enemy health.
- Projectile animations.
- Currency and rewards.
- Wave progression.
- Victory and defeat conditions.

# 4. GAME ENGINEERING REQUIREMENTS

For each game, implement:

- Dedicated game scene.
- 3D models or procedurally generated geometry.
- Lighting and shadows.
- Camera controls.
- Collision detection.
- Physics where required.
- Player controller.
- Enemy AI where applicable.
- Game states: READY, PLAYING, PAUSED, WON, LOST.
- Score tracking.
- Restart button.
- Main menu button.
- Sound controls.
- Difficulty selection.
- Loading screen.
- Instructions screen.

Do not make the 20 games all behave like the same template. Each game must have gameplay mechanics appropriate to its genre.

# 5. CONTROLS

Desktop:
- WASD / Arrow Keys: Movement.
- Mouse: Camera and aiming where applicable.
- Space: Jump or action.
- Shift: Sprint or boost.
- E: Interact.
- Escape: Pause.
- Game-specific keys displayed in the instructions.

Mobile:
- Virtual joystick.
- Touch buttons.
- Swipe camera controls.
- Responsive HUD.
- Full-screen mode.

Controls must change according to the active game.

# 6. GAME PLATFORM FEATURES

Create the following platform features:

- Game search.
- Category filters.
- Featured games.
- Favorites.
- Recently played.
- Game history.
- Player profiles.
- High scores.
- Global leaderboard.
- Difficulty levels.
- Sound settings.
- Graphics settings.
- Full-screen gameplay.
- Loading progress.
- Responsive mobile layout.

Store scores and game preferences persistently when a backend is available. Do not claim a global leaderboard if scores are only stored locally.

# 7. 3D GRAPHICS AND PERFORMANCE

Requirements:

- Use optimized GLTF/GLB models where available.
- Use procedural models for simple objects.
- Avoid unnecessarily large assets.
- Implement texture optimization.
- Use instancing for repeated objects.
- Use efficient shadows and lighting.
- Support quality levels: Low, Medium and High.
- Detect WebGL availability.
- Provide fallback messages when WebGL is unavailable.
- Pause rendering when gameplay is inactive where appropriate.
- Dispose of geometries, textures and materials when leaving game scenes.
- Avoid memory leaks.
- Keep mobile performance in mind.

Do not use copyrighted game assets without permission. Use original, licensed or properly attributed assets.

# 8. PROJECT ARCHITECTURE

Build a modular structure appropriate to the existing project.

Suggested organization:

src/
  components/
    layout/
    navigation/
    game-cards/
    dashboard/
    common/

  games/
    open-world/
    zombie-survival/
    battle-arena/
    treasure-hunter/
    parkour/
    supercar-racing/
    motorcycle-racing/
    offroad-driving/
    space-racing/
    football/
    basketball/
    cricket/
    tennis/
    city-builder/
    flight-simulator/
    tank-battle/
    space-exploration/
    maze-runner/
    chess/
    tower-defense/

  engine/
    GameEngine/
    GameLoader/
    PhysicsManager/
    AudioManager/
    InputManager/
    SceneManager/

  hooks/
  services/
  store/
  types/
  utils/
  pages/

Adapt this structure to the actual existing repository rather than blindly replacing its architecture.

# 9. DEVELOPMENT PROCESS

Follow these phases:

PHASE 1: Inspect the existing project and report its technology stack and current structure.

PHASE 2: Build the gaming homepage, navigation, responsive layout and reusable game cards.

PHASE 3: Implement the common 3D engine infrastructure and game loader.

PHASE 4: Develop the 20 games individually with actual gameplay.

PHASE 5: Integrate game controls, scoring, game states and audio.

PHASE 6: Add player profiles, favorites, history and leaderboards.

PHASE 7: Optimize 3D rendering and mobile responsiveness.

PHASE 8: Test every game individually and fix errors.

PHASE 9: Prepare production build and deployment documentation.

Work incrementally. Do not generate 20 incomplete game placeholders and claim completion.

# 10. TESTING AND ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA

The project is complete only when:

1. All 20 games appear in the gaming platform.
2. Each game opens its own gameplay screen.
3. Each game has a functioning 3D scene.
4. Player controls work.
5. Game mechanics work.
6. Collision and scoring work where relevant.
7. Win and loss conditions work.
8. Pause and restart work.
9. Mobile controls work for supported games.
10. Game navigation works without breaking other games.
11. No major console errors.
12. No critical memory leaks from switching game scenes.
13. The website builds successfully.
14. Existing project functionality remains intact.

Provide:
- Complete source code.
- Updated project structure.
- Installation instructions.
- Environment variable documentation.
- Development commands.
- Production build commands.
- Game-by-game testing checklist.
- Known limitations.

FINAL INSTRUCTION:

Start by inspecting the existing repository. Then implement the gaming platform in working phases. Prioritize complete playable games over visual placeholders. Do not delete existing project files or overwrite existing functionality without understanding their purpose.

If a game cannot be completed in the current phase, clearly report what is implemented and what remains. Never label a placeholder as a completed game." data-testid="chatgpt-writing-block" data-writing-block-variant="document" style="--oai-wb-spacing: var(--spacing,0.25rem); --oai-wb-text-primary: var(--wb-text-primary,var(--color-token-text-primary,var(--text-primary,#0d0d0d))); --oai-wb-text-secondary: var(--wb-text-secondary,var(--color-token-text-secondary,var(--text-secondary,#5d5d5d))); --oai-wb-text-tertiary: var(--wb-text-tertiary,var(--color-token-text-tertiary,var(--text-tertiary,#8f8f8f))); --oai-wb-surface-primary: var(--wb-surface-primary,var(--color-token-main-surface-primary,var(--main-surface-primary,#fff))); --oai-wb-surface-secondary: var(--wb-surface-secondary,var(--color-token-bg-tertiary,var(--main-surface-secondary,#f5f5f5))); --oai-wb-interactive-secondary-hover: var(--wb-interactive-secondary-hover,var(--color-token-interactive-bg-secondary-hover,var(--oai-wb-surface-secondary))); --oai-wb-border: var(--wb-border,var(--color-token-border,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/8%)))); --oai-wb-border-hover: var(--wb-border-hover,var(--color-token-border-default,var(--border-medium,rgb(0 0 0/12%)))); --oai-wb-divider: var(--wb-divider,var(--color-token-border-light,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/5%)))); --oai-wb-focus: var(--wb-focus,var(--color-token-focus-border,var(--border-strong,#5b9dd9))); --oai-wb-control-border: var(--wb-control-border,var(--interactive-border-focus,var(--oai-wb-focus))); --oai-wb-entity-accent: var(--wb-entity-accent,var(--theme-entity-accent,var(--oai-wb-accent))); --oai-wb-accent: var(--wb-accent,var(--interactive-label-accent-default,#0285ff)); --oai-wb-on-accent: var(--wb-on-accent,var(--bg-primary,#fff)); --oai-wb-interactive-background: var(--wb-interactive-background,var(--interactive-bg-accent-default,color-mix(in srgb,#0285ff 12%,transparent))); --oai-wb-selection: var(--wb-selection,var(--theme-user-selection-bg,var(--selection,#93c5fd))); --oai-wb-radius: var(--wb-radius,1.5rem); --oai-wb-radius-sm: var(--wb-radius-sm,0.5rem); --oai-wb-shadow: var(--wb-shadow,0 4px 80px rgb(0 0 0/2%)); --oai-wb-shadow-lg: var(--wb-shadow-lg,0 10px 30px rgb(0 0 0/12%)); --oai-wb-font-sans: var(--wb-font-sans,var(--font-sans,sans-serif)); --oai-wb-font-mono: var(--wb-font-mono,var(--font-mono,monospace)); --oai-wb-font-size: var(--wb-font-size,0.875rem); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-contrast: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-contrast,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary)); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-secondary: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-secondary,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary));"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] z-[-1] [background:var(--oai-wb-surface-primary)]"></div><div class="relative z-[1]"><header class="flex min-w-0 select-none items-center gap-[calc(var(--oai-wb-spacing)*2)] px-[calc(var(--oai-wb-spacing)*4)] py-[calc(var(--oai-wb-spacing)*2.5)] header-rXCNwJ sticky z-10 pe-2 pt-2 pb-2 [--wb-font-size:var(--text-sm)] !ps-0 !pe-2 !py-2" style="--oai-wb-spacing: var(--spacing,0.25rem); --oai-wb-text-primary: var(--wb-text-primary,var(--color-token-text-primary,var(--text-primary,#0d0d0d))); --oai-wb-text-secondary: var(--wb-text-secondary,var(--color-token-text-secondary,var(--text-secondary,#5d5d5d))); --oai-wb-text-tertiary: var(--wb-text-tertiary,var(--color-token-text-tertiary,var(--text-tertiary,#8f8f8f))); --oai-wb-surface-primary: var(--wb-surface-primary,var(--color-token-main-surface-primary,var(--main-surface-primary,#fff))); --oai-wb-surface-secondary: var(--wb-surface-secondary,var(--color-token-bg-tertiary,var(--main-surface-secondary,#f5f5f5))); --oai-wb-interactive-secondary-hover: var(--wb-interactive-secondary-hover,var(--color-token-interactive-bg-secondary-hover,var(--oai-wb-surface-secondary))); --oai-wb-border: var(--wb-border,var(--color-token-border,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/8%)))); --oai-wb-border-hover: var(--wb-border-hover,var(--color-token-border-default,var(--border-medium,rgb(0 0 0/12%)))); --oai-wb-divider: var(--wb-divider,var(--color-token-border-light,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/5%)))); --oai-wb-focus: var(--wb-focus,var(--color-token-focus-border,var(--border-strong,#5b9dd9))); --oai-wb-control-border: var(--wb-control-border,var(--interactive-border-focus,var(--oai-wb-focus))); --oai-wb-entity-accent: var(--wb-entity-accent,var(--theme-entity-accent,var(--oai-wb-accent))); --oai-wb-accent: var(--wb-accent,var(--interactive-label-accent-default,#0285ff)); --oai-wb-on-accent: var(--wb-on-accent,var(--bg-primary,#fff)); --oai-wb-interactive-background: var(--wb-interactive-background,var(--interactive-bg-accent-default,color-mix(in srgb,#0285ff 12%,transparent))); --oai-wb-selection: var(--wb-selection,var(--theme-user-selection-bg,var(--selection,#93c5fd))); --oai-wb-radius: var(--wb-radius,1.5rem); --oai-wb-radius-sm: var(--wb-radius-sm,0.5rem); --oai-wb-shadow: var(--wb-shadow,0 4px 80px rgb(0 0 0/2%)); --oai-wb-shadow-lg: var(--wb-shadow-lg,0 10px 30px rgb(0 0 0/12%)); --oai-wb-font-sans: var(--wb-font-sans,var(--font-sans,sans-serif)); --oai-wb-font-mono: var(--wb-font-mono,var(--font-mono,monospace)); --oai-wb-font-size: var(--wb-font-size,0.875rem); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-contrast: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-contrast,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary)); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-secondary: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-secondary,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary));"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-[1_1_auto] items-center gap-[calc(var(--oai-wb-spacing)*2)]"><div class="ms-2 flex min-w-0 grow items-center text-sm font-normal select-none"><span class="min-w-0 truncate px-3 py-2 text-tertiary"><span class="text-tertiary">Writing</span></span></div></div><div class="flex flex-[0_0_auto] items-center gap-[var(--oai-wb-spacing)]"><div class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/startup-v2/optimized/assets/icons-8f0081c9239bae1d.svg#codex-icon-square-on-square-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Open editor" data-state="closed"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/startup-v2/optimized/assets/icons-8f0081c9239bae1d.svg#codex-icon-arrow-up-right-arrow-down-left-sm-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></header><div><div></div><div><div class="relative"><div class="content-mUPWP6" data-markdown-copy-content="true" dir="auto"><div class="editor-jMsqTn writing-block-editor magic-edit-minimal" data-newline-selection-appearance="default" data-table-selection-appearance="default" style="--oai-wb-spacing: var(--spacing,0.25rem); --oai-wb-text-primary: var(--wb-text-primary,var(--color-token-text-primary,var(--text-primary,#0d0d0d))); --oai-wb-text-secondary: var(--wb-text-secondary,var(--color-token-text-secondary,var(--text-secondary,#5d5d5d))); --oai-wb-text-tertiary: var(--wb-text-tertiary,var(--color-token-text-tertiary,var(--text-tertiary,#8f8f8f))); --oai-wb-surface-primary: var(--wb-surface-primary,var(--color-token-main-surface-primary,var(--main-surface-primary,#fff))); --oai-wb-surface-secondary: var(--wb-surface-secondary,var(--color-token-bg-tertiary,var(--main-surface-secondary,#f5f5f5))); --oai-wb-interactive-secondary-hover: var(--wb-interactive-secondary-hover,var(--color-token-interactive-bg-secondary-hover,var(--oai-wb-surface-secondary))); --oai-wb-border: var(--wb-border,var(--color-token-border,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/8%)))); --oai-wb-border-hover: var(--wb-border-hover,var(--color-token-border-default,var(--border-medium,rgb(0 0 0/12%)))); --oai-wb-divider: var(--wb-divider,var(--color-token-border-light,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/5%)))); --oai-wb-focus: var(--wb-focus,var(--color-token-focus-border,var(--border-strong,#5b9dd9))); --oai-wb-control-border: var(--wb-control-border,var(--interactive-border-focus,var(--oai-wb-focus))); --oai-wb-entity-accent: var(--wb-entity-accent,var(--theme-entity-accent,var(--oai-wb-accent))); --oai-wb-accent: var(--wb-accent,var(--interactive-label-accent-default,#0285ff)); --oai-wb-on-accent: var(--wb-on-accent,var(--bg-primary,#fff)); --oai-wb-interactive-background: var(--wb-interactive-background,var(--interactive-bg-accent-default,color-mix(in srgb,#0285ff 12%,transparent))); --oai-wb-selection: var(--wb-selection,var(--theme-user-selection-bg,var(--selection,#93c5fd))); --oai-wb-radius: var(--wb-radius,1.5rem); --oai-wb-radius-sm: var(--wb-radius-sm,0.5rem); --oai-wb-shadow: var(--wb-shadow,0 4px 80px rgb(0 0 0/2%)); --oai-wb-shadow-lg: var(--wb-shadow-lg,0 10px 30px rgb(0 0 0/12%)); --oai-wb-font-sans: var(--wb-font-sans,var(--font-sans,sans-serif)); --oai-wb-font-mono: var(--wb-font-mono,var(--font-mono,monospace)); --oai-wb-font-size: var(--wb-font-size,0.875rem); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-contrast: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-contrast,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary)); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-secondary: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-secondary,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary));"><div contenteditable="true" aria-label="Start writing" aria-multiline="true" role="textbox" translate="no" class="ProseMirror content-xaiQhS leading-relaxed"><h1 dir="auto"><span>MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT: 3D ARCADE GAMING PLATFORM – 20 PLAYABLE GAMES</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>Act as a senior game developer, Three.js/WebGL engineer, full-stack developer, 3D gameplay designer, UI/UX architect and software architect.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Your task is to design and develop a complete, professional, responsive </span><strong><span>3D Gaming Website containing 20 playable 3D games</span></strong><span>.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>The result must feel like a premium gaming platform, similar in presentation quality to modern browser gaming portals.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>IMPORTANT: Do not create only a landing page, static game cards, fake buttons or gameplay screenshots. Every game must have a functional gameplay loop, controls, scoring, collision detection, win/lose conditions and restart functionality.</span></p><div contenteditable="false"><hr></div><h1 dir="auto"><span>1. TECHNOLOGY STACK</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>First inspect the existing project and identify its framework, folder structure, package manager and current architecture.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Preserve existing functionality if integrating into an existing application.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Recommended technology:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Frontend: React + TypeScript</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>3D engine: Three.js</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>React integration: React Three Fiber</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>3D helpers: Drei</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Physics: Rapier</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Styling: Tailwind CSS or existing styling system</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Animations: Framer Motion</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Backend: Existing backend if available</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Database: Existing database or PostgreSQL</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Authentication: Existing authentication system</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>State management: Zustand or existing state solution</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Build tool: Existing Vite/Next.js setup</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Do not introduce duplicate frameworks or unnecessary dependencies.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Use modular architecture. Optimize 3D rendering for desktop and mobile browsers.</span></p><h1 dir="auto"><span>2. WEBSITE BRANDING AND DESIGN</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>Create a premium gaming brand.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Suggested name: NEXUS 3D ARCADE</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Visual direction:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Dark futuristic interface.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Black and deep navy backgrounds.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Neon purple, electric blue and cyan highlights.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Glassmorphism panels.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Smooth transitions and animated backgrounds.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>High-quality 3D game thumbnails.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Modern gaming typography.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Responsive card layouts.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Attractive hover effects.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Premium dashboard appearance.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Main navigation:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Home</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>All Games</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Action</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Racing</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Sports</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Adventure</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Multiplayer</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Leaderboard</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>My Profile</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Homepage sections:</span></p><ol start="1" data-spread="false" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 2ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Hero banner featuring a highlighted 3D game.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Featured Games.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Popular Games.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Recently Added.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Action and Adventure.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Racing and Driving.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Sports.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Puzzle and Simulation.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>All 20 Games.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Footer with platform information.</span></p></li></ol><h1 dir="auto"><span>3. BUILD THESE 20 PLAYABLE 3D GAMES</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>Every game must have its own dedicated gameplay screen, controls, 3D environment, scoring system and game states.</span></p><h2 dir="auto"><span>ACTION AND ADVENTURE</span></h2><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 1: Open World Adventure</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a third-person 3D exploration game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Explore a 3D city.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Walk, run and jump.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Enter and exit supported vehicles.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Collect coins and objects.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Complete missions.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Map and navigation system.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>NPC characters.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Mission completion rewards.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 2: Zombie Survival</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D zombie survival game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Zombie AI.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Player health.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Weapon system.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Ammunition.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Zombie attack animations.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Survival waves.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Health packs.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Increasing difficulty.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Game-over and restart screens.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 3: Battle Arena</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D arena combat game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Third-person player movement.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>AI opponents.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Weapon mechanics.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Health and shield.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Shooting and hit detection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Multiple arena environments.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Score and kill counter.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Victory and defeat conditions.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 4: Treasure Hunter</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D treasure exploration game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Ancient temple environment.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Hidden treasure chests.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Environmental puzzles.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Moving platforms.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Traps and obstacles.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Collectible objects.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Multiple levels.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Level completion rewards.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 5: Extreme Parkour</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D parkour game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Running and jumping.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Wall climbing.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Sliding.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Rooftop environments.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Moving platforms.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Obstacles.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Checkpoints.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Timer and distance scoring.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir="auto"><span>RACING AND DRIVING</span></h2><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 6: Supercar Racing</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D racing simulator.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Multiple sports cars.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Realistic acceleration and braking.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Steering and drifting.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Nitro boost.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>AI opponents.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Racing tracks.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Lap counter.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Speedometer.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Race timer.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Finish-line detection.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 7: Motorcycle Racing</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D motorcycle racing game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Multiple motorcycles.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Bike leaning.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Road physics.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Traffic obstacles.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Racing checkpoints.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Speed boosts.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Bike selection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Race results.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 8: Off-Road Driving</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D off-road driving simulator.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Jeep and 4x4 vehicles.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Mud and rocky terrain.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Mountain roads.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Vehicle suspension.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Obstacles.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Checkpoints.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Time-based challenges.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 9: Space Racing</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a futuristic 3D spaceship racing game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Spaceship selection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Space tracks.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Asteroid obstacles.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Boost mechanics.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>AI racers.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Lap system.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Futuristic visual effects.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir="auto"><span>SPORTS</span></h2><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 10: Football 3D</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D football game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Player movement.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Ball physics.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Goal detection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Goalkeeper AI.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Shooting and passing.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Match timer.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Scoreboard.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Match completion.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 11: Basketball 3D</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D basketball game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Basketball court.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Player movement.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Ball throwing physics.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Hoop collision detection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Scoring system.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Time challenges.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Scoreboard.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 12: Cricket 3D</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D cricket game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Batting mechanics.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Bowling mechanics.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Ball physics.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Wickets.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Runs and overs.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Boundary detection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Match score.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Match result.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 13: Tennis 3D</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D tennis game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Tennis court.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Player movement.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Ball physics.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Serve and return.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>AI opponent.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Net collision.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Points and sets.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir="auto"><span>SIMULATION AND STRATEGY</span></h2><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 14: City Builder 3D</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D city construction game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Place buildings.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Build roads.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Manage resources.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Population system.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>City expansion.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Budget management.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Camera rotation and zoom.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 15: Flight Simulator</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D airplane simulator.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Aircraft controls.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Takeoff and landing.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Altitude indicator.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Speed indicator.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Flight camera.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Airport environment.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Flight challenges.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 16: Tank Battle</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D tank combat game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Tank movement.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Turret rotation.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Projectile physics.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>AI enemy tanks.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Health system.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Destructible targets.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Battle arenas.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 17: Space Exploration</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D space exploration game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Explore planets.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Spaceship controls.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Asteroid fields.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Planet landing zones.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Collect resources.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Solar systems.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Exploration missions.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir="auto"><span>CLASSIC AND PUZZLE GAMES</span></h2><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 18: 3D Maze Runner</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D maze exploration game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Procedurally generated or predefined mazes.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>First-person camera.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Collectible keys.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Locked doors.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Timer.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Traps.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Exit detection.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 19: 3D Chess</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a fully playable 3D chess game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>3D chessboard.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>3D chess pieces.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Legal move validation.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Check and checkmate detection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Player versus AI.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Two-player local mode.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Undo move.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Restart game.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir="auto"><span>Game 20: 3D Tower Defense</span></h3><p dir="auto"><span>Create a 3D tower defense game.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>3D map.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Enemy waves.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Tower placement.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Tower upgrades.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Enemy health.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Projectile animations.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Currency and rewards.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Wave progression.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Victory and defeat conditions.</span></p></li></ul><h1 dir="auto"><span>4. GAME ENGINEERING REQUIREMENTS</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>For each game, implement:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Dedicated game scene.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>3D models or procedurally generated geometry.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Lighting and shadows.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Camera controls.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Collision detection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Physics where required.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Player controller.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Enemy AI where applicable.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Game states: READY, PLAYING, PAUSED, WON, LOST.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Score tracking.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Restart button.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Main menu button.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Sound controls.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Difficulty selection.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Loading screen.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Instructions screen.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Do not make the 20 games all behave like the same template. Each game must have gameplay mechanics appropriate to its genre.</span></p><h1 dir="auto"><span>5. CONTROLS</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>Desktop:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>WASD / Arrow Keys: Movement.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Mouse: Camera and aiming where applicable.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Space: Jump or action.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Shift: Sprint or boost.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>E: Interact.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Escape: Pause.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Game-specific keys displayed in the instructions.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Mobile:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Virtual joystick.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Touch buttons.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Swipe camera controls.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Responsive HUD.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Full-screen mode.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Controls must change according to the active game.</span></p><h1 dir="auto"><span>6. GAME PLATFORM FEATURES</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>Create the following platform features:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Game search.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Category filters.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Featured games.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Favorites.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Recently played.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Game history.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Player profiles.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>High scores.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Global leaderboard.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Difficulty levels.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Sound settings.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Graphics settings.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Full-screen gameplay.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Loading progress.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Responsive mobile layout.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Store scores and game preferences persistently when a backend is available. Do not claim a global leaderboard if scores are only stored locally.</span></p><h1 dir="auto"><span>7. 3D GRAPHICS AND PERFORMANCE</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>Requirements:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Use optimized GLTF/GLB models where available.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Use procedural models for simple objects.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Avoid unnecessarily large assets.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Implement texture optimization.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Use instancing for repeated objects.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Use efficient shadows and lighting.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Support quality levels: Low, Medium and High.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Detect WebGL availability.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Provide fallback messages when WebGL is unavailable.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Pause rendering when gameplay is inactive where appropriate.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Dispose of geometries, textures and materials when leaving game scenes.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Avoid memory leaks.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Keep mobile performance in mind.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>Do not use copyrighted game assets without permission. Use original, licensed or properly attributed assets.</span></p><h1 dir="auto"><span>8. PROJECT ARCHITECTURE</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>Build a modular structure appropriate to the existing project.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Suggested organization:</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>src/</span><br><span>components/</span><br><span>layout/</span><br><span>navigation/</span><br><span>game-cards/</span><br><span>dashboard/</span><br><span>common/</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>games/</span><br><span>open-world/</span><br><span>zombie-survival/</span><br><span>battle-arena/</span><br><span>treasure-hunter/</span><br><span>parkour/</span><br><span>supercar-racing/</span><br><span>motorcycle-racing/</span><br><span>offroad-driving/</span><br><span>space-racing/</span><br><span>football/</span><br><span>basketball/</span><br><span>cricket/</span><br><span>tennis/</span><br><span>city-builder/</span><br><span>flight-simulator/</span><br><span>tank-battle/</span><br><span>space-exploration/</span><br><span>maze-runner/</span><br><span>chess/</span><br><span>tower-defense/</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>engine/</span><br><span>GameEngine/</span><br><span>GameLoader/</span><br><span>PhysicsManager/</span><br><span>AudioManager/</span><br><span>InputManager/</span><br><span>SceneManager/</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>hooks/</span><br><span>services/</span><br><span>store/</span><br><span>types/</span><br><span>utils/</span><br><span>pages/</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Adapt this structure to the actual existing repository rather than blindly replacing its architecture.</span></p><h1 dir="auto"><span>9. DEVELOPMENT PROCESS</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>Follow these phases:</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 1: Inspect the existing project and report its technology stack and current structure.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 2: Build the gaming homepage, navigation, responsive layout and reusable game cards.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 3: Implement the common 3D engine infrastructure and game loader.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 4: Develop the 20 games individually with actual gameplay.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 5: Integrate game controls, scoring, game states and audio.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 6: Add player profiles, favorites, history and leaderboards.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 7: Optimize 3D rendering and mobile responsiveness.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 8: Test every game individually and fix errors.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>PHASE 9: Prepare production build and deployment documentation.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Work incrementally. Do not generate 20 incomplete game placeholders and claim completion.</span></p><h1 dir="auto"><span>10. TESTING AND ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA</span></h1><p dir="auto"><span>The project is complete only when:</span></p><ol start="1" data-spread="false" style="--rich-text-list-marker-width: 2ch;"><li><p dir="auto"><span>All 20 games appear in the gaming platform.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Each game opens its own gameplay screen.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Each game has a functioning 3D scene.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Player controls work.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Game mechanics work.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Collision and scoring work where relevant.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Win and loss conditions work.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Pause and restart work.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Mobile controls work for supported games.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Game navigation works without breaking other games.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>No major console errors.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>No critical memory leaks from switching game scenes.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>The website builds successfully.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Existing project functionality remains intact.</span></p></li></ol><p dir="auto"><span>Provide:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Complete source code.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Updated project structure.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Installation instructions.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Environment variable documentation.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Development commands.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Production build commands.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Game-by-game testing checklist.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Known limitations.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="auto"><span>FINAL INSTRUCTION:</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>Start by inspecting the existing repository. Then implement the gaming platform in working phases. Prioritize complete playable games over visual placeholders. Do not delete existing project files or overwrite existing functionality without understanding their purpose.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>If a game cannot be completed in the current phase, clearly report what is implemented and what remains. Never label a placeholder as a completed game.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] z-[2] [box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--oai-wb-border)] group-hover/writing-block-surface:[box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--oai-wb-border-hover)]"></div></div></div><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">Recommended visual direction</h2><div class="Grid-CGRmTR" data-d-component="grid" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0px, 1fr));"><div class="Box-qIMv6G Item-ev4eoI" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="grid-item" data-d-direction="col" style="--grid-item-column: auto; --grid-item-row: auto;"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 5 / 4; background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); height: auto; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="Image-eK79_D OverlayBox-vnB7gO LoadingFrame-p8B6Sc group/search-image" data-d-component="image" data-d-frame="" data-d-hover-zoom="" style="border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 5 / 4; height: 100%; width: 100%; overflow: hidden;"><img alt="Neon Dashboard designs, themes, templates and downloadable graphic elements on Dribbble" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="Image-LDLXtM Image-eK79_D LoadingImage-HroCZg" data-loaded="" draggable="false" src="./file exploer ui_files/tZmRrJeFMO-gl4StGKUMrCoBvqeonutcF4GmkuF_B0jsxhgIoT4PiSEPVG5dUWX9pICLUYqd4oME9z4CRb8gdeMe6wqAydrm7FB4sBWz-cD1UlF3tVSCyZBeeYjzqs5Ao8i5m5hf_3Vudlh9XlUnyhYae4pOCZ1UxwEvhFjKrlo" style="border-radius: var(--dil